<title>JAPAN: Moody's considers downgrading Yamaichi Sec ratings.</title>
<headline>Moody's considers downgrading Yamaichi Sec ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Wednesday it had placed Yamaichi Securities Co's Baa3 and Prime-3 ratings under review for possible downgrade.  </p>
<p>The rating firm said that the review was prompted by Yamaichi's declining market share over the past two years and negative earnings prospects, coupled with increasing competitive challenges from domestic and foreign firms.</p>
</text>
